p.src:
Let $B_1$ denote the first real business engine. The founder has two very different questions available: $\begin{aligned}
&\text{How do we become excellent at } B_1? \\
&\text{How do we reduce our exposure to } B_1?\end{aligned}$ The first question is about mastery. The second is about cushioning. The speaker’s warning is that cushioning can arrive before mastery.

