p.src:
The order matters more than the number. Diversification comes after evidence that one commercial engine works: $\text{focus}
\longrightarrow
\text{revenue proof}
\longrightarrow
\text{possible expansion}.$ That is the payoff of the answer. The speaker is not merely saying do less. He is saying that breadth should be earned by depth.

